			Text = "\tSentruko & Studimi\tNow 550/550 (+100/+100)\n\tGuest\tEffect now triggers only twice each turn (from uncapped)\n\tGangmanstyle556\tNow summons each copy from your baseplate (from just one)\n\tPreston\tNow 500/600 (+0/+50)\n\tNelta, Sanguine Cleric\tNow {W} 8{R} (+{R})\n\tFeral Citizen\tNow 900/300 (+100/+0)\n\tTempted by Redemption\tNow {W}{W}{G}{Y} (-{W}); Now gives 250 Health and Power (from 200)\n\tSmoox\tNow {W}{Y}{Y}{Y}{Y}{Y)(-{W})\n\tViolent Creation\tNow {W}{R}{R}{R}{R} (+{R}). Effect now \"Destroy a target allied fighter. Select an unranked fighter card from your deck that costs fewer studs than that fighter and summon it, triggering effects as if it was cast.\"\n\tKathara Sojourner\tNow 300/400 (+100/+100); Now gains 300 health if its target has less than 600 health (from gaining 600 power); Now loses 300 life if it doesn't (from 600)\n\tIronInforcer\tNow gives +250/+250 (from +200/+200)\n\tCoeptus\tNow 700/400 (-200/-0)\n\tAlar Blade Archer\tNow 650/650 (+50/+50)\n\tAlar Blade Chaser\tNow 650/650 (+50/+50)\n\tPlatinumFalls\tEffect now \"When this card is cast: Give yourself a Studling card of each colour in your baseplate.\" (From for each)\n\tFuse Bomb\tNow {W}{R} (-{R})\n\tKilnkin Outfitter\tNow 400/500 (-100/-0)\n\tMouth of Kala\tNow {R}{Y}{Y}{Y} (-{Y})\n\t2hex\tMoonleak given now costs {W} (From {W}{W})\n\tYour mum\tNow cooks lasanga 20% faster\n\tDebt Collector\tNow 200/200 (+100/+100)\n\tBotanical Beggar\tNow {G}{G}{Y} (+{G} - {Y})\n\tStaySpy\tNow requires 8 or more cards in hand to trigger (from 9)\n\tJayTheCoder\tNow 900/700 (+200/+0)\n\tWANTED ADeadBody14\tNow reduces by {W} (from {W}{Y})\n\tNova Wand\tNow {Y}{Y}{Y}{Y} (-{Y})\n\t65Popcan \tNow 450/450 (-150/+150)\n\n\tEcocide\tNow destroys the opponent's terrain (from all players' terrains)\n\tAdead & Lavatik, B. B. Stars\tNow triggers if there's 13 or more actions in your graveyard (from 2000 or less life)\n\tAngry Local\tNow 550/300 (+50/+0)\n\tDodgeball Player Red\tNow damages enemy fighters only. Now uses OETT Tech.\n\tJust Ice-Cream Bot\tNow 900/500 (+100/+0)\n\tGrinning Goliath\tNow ransacks nonfighter cards (from action/terrains)\n\tMrEyeSo\tNow destroys enemy fighters (from swapping all fighters). Now buffs only allied fighters. Now 800/300 (-0/-200)\n\tDun_Goof\tNow 250/400 (+100/+0)\n\tB550\tNow {R}{R} 250/250 (-{W}{R}, -300/-100)\n\tPanwellz\tNow {W}{W}{Y}{Y}{Y} (-{W})\n\n\tAuthoritarian Zone\tFrom Myrmiredon, Head of the ACGD\n\tThe DS Megabuffs\t\n\tDragonspine Whip\tNow 100/400 (-100/+100)\n\tGoreswimmer\tNow 950/100 (+250/+0)\n\tHysteria Parasytia\tNow costs {W}{W}{W}{Y}{Y} (-{Y})\n\tSin Stone\tNow grants +150/+150 stat bonus (+100/+100)\n\tCulture Technician\tNow has overload.\n\tNethercreep's Bulwark\tNow {W}{W}{B}{B} (-{W})\n\tThalassic Technician\tNow has a target fighter lose 300 power (from 200). Now only triggers on your turn.\n\tWayfarer, Sacred Spear\tNow grants +400/+200 stat bonus (+200/+0). Now triggers after attack (from when it attacks)\n\tSword of Nefertiti\tNow {Y}{Y} (-{W})\n\tSmouldering Delonix\tNow 1000/300 (+100/+0). Now removes {W}{R}{G} from the costs of terrains it gives.\n\tEnthralled to Creation\tCan now cast cards that cost fewer studs (from only exactly equal)\n\tNarrowminded Oddities\tNow summons a 400/300 Noob (from 400/100)\n\tImpressionable Kin\tNow 50/1000 (-150/+400), now gains 150 health per card in graveyard (from 100). Now has overload.\n\tTranscendental Hug\tNow {W}{Y}{Y}{Y} (-{W})\n\tThe Sacrifice\tEffect now \"Whenever you cast a Terrain: Summon 2 300/300 Shadowbeasts that're inert in play. When this card dies: For each fighter that's died since this card entered play, you gain {W}{G} and give yourself a Green card.\"\n\tNyarlhotep's Razor\tNow {Y}{Y} (-{W}{Y})\n\tPious Adherent\tReverted. Now 1150/1150 (+0/+350)\n\tShedarian Scholar \tNow requires 8 different shinies in graveyard (from 10)\n\tThe Purifier\tNow unstoppable. Now gains 1000 power per terrain destroyed (from doubling power)\n\tValerian Ranger\tNow 400/200 (-100/-0). Now gives a target fighter 200 health when cast.\n\n\tLevel Up!\tNow puts itself into baseplate (from bottom of graveyard)\n\tRare Loot Pile\tNow puts itself into baseplate (from bottom of graveyard). Now inert in all zones.\n\tOverleveler\tNow destroys an EXP card in your baseplate (from obliterating one in your graveyard)\n\tTime Gone By\tNow destroys an EXP card in your baseplate (from putting one in your graveyard on the bottom of your deck)\n\n\tScrap Slinger\tNow marks a fighter after attack (from attack)\n\tMonkrymonkry\tNow 500/600 (-0/-100). Now attaches marked to all fighters when cast.\n\tAlloy appraiser\tCard draw mode now triggers once each turn. (From unlimited)\n\tKilnkin Wheeler\tNow destroys all gear attached to it (instead of just flaws)\n\tKilnkin Behemoth\tNow destroys all gear attached to it (instead of just flaws)\n\tIsolation Border Patrol\tNow destroys all gear attached to it (instead of just flaws)\n\n\tKorblox General\tNow locks for 1 turn (from 2)\n\tOSHA Zone\tMaking your life idiotproof since 1998\n\tMods\tNow also obliterate all additional copies of them in your graveyard during your end step.\n\n\tLuna Zone\tNew cards and additions!\n\txxdemonninjaxx\tRed Epic; {W}{R}{R}{B}{B}{B} 700/300; Once each turn, whenever an allied Ninja fighter that costs 5 or fewer total studs dies: Summon a fading copy of it, triggering its effects when cast. Then return the copy to its hand.\n\tApocryphic Seeker\tGreen Rare;{W}{G}{G}{G}{G}{G}{G} 500/700; When this card is cast: Put a Doomed blessing onto 3 cards in your hand. Give yourself 3 Green cards."
