			Text = "<b>10th Anniversary Event is now live!</b>\nEarn Balloons from battles in queue and weekly quests to exchange for rewards! Earn twice as much BB and gain foils twice as fast during the event! Get a unique set of alt-arts of popular cards! All available until August 15th! Click on the event button on your menu for more details!\n\n-----\n<b>Minor Follow-up Balance Patch</b>\nA small balance patch has been done to correct some changes and address a few small things we missed with the previous balance patch.\n\nFrom Lid, ACGD Intern\n\nMeka Warrior: now 300/400 (-50/0) - widely hated by multiple people, bit too potent of a snowballer that has a ton going for it. more punishable\nTherapy Dog: now 600/200 (0/-100) - mistake\nFinland: Effect now generates a red stud (from yellow) - lets you do CF/Finland stuff without letting you chain multiple finlands together for omega cheeky no CAloss 7-drops t2\nInfurnished cultist: Infurnished given now fleeting. Now 500/200 (0/+50) - this was the wrong nerf, fixing\nThe Sacrifice: Effect now only counts allied fighters (from any) - we forgot a Grexit straggler\nDevRolve: Token summoned is now inert in all zones. - Was part of last patch but not on the sheet, now fixed\nJennyHailings: Reverted.\n\n\n"
