				Text = "<b>Authoritarian Zone</b><br />From Myrmiredon, head of the AGCD, with the intern Lid<br /><i>The following changes have been made by the ACGD</i>"
			},
			{
				Text = "<b>Korblox</b><br /><br /><i>There is a consistent complaint that Korblox are the worst starter deck by a large margin. Investigating, some of this is korblox being a bit weak but a lot of it is it having too high a skill floor to properly function as a starter deck. A frequent complaint is how scattered the group was and how it was \"all over the place,\" despite it being a toolboxy control deck and thus needing all those tools. This change hopes to keep korblox's identity as a fair midrange dominator while giving it a more linear and obvious gameplan.</i>"
