				Text = "<b>Korblox Squire</b><br />Now 350/200. Effect now \"When your effects have targeted this turn: All allied Korblox gain 50 Health.\"<br /><i>This is a state trigger, something we've used a fair amount in DSA2 and love due to how they make sequencing easier. This will trigger once each turn when the statement is true. If you target then cast squire, you get the buff immediately. If you cast squire then target </i>"
