			{
				Text = "<b>Fleeing Survivors</b><br />Now {R}{R} (-{W} +{R})<br /><i>Maple collector was nerfed for allowing specific decks access to 7 studs T2/T3 fairly easily. This card allows monored, the non-ramp colour, to have access to 9 red T3 fairly easily. This change helps to keep one of red's most iconic cards good (specifically in giant worm decks) while still being slower.</i>"
