			Text = "Buy the Dies of Death cards today at the shop, based around manipulating the top card of your opponent's deck!\nUse the code DIEOFDEATH to immediately gain 2000 bloxbux to purchase it!\n\t\t\t\nBadware\nGreen Common\n{W}{B} 200/200\nWhen this card is cast: Put a computer on top of your opponent's deck.\n(Computer: \nInert in all zones.\nUndiscardable.\nWhen this card enters your hand: Draw a card, then give your opponent a fleeting Nascent Stud.\nThe top card of your deck is revealed while this card is in your hand.)\n\nKilldroid\nRed Uncommon\n{W}{W}{W}{R}{B} 300/500\nWhen this card is cast: Destroy the top card of your opponent's deck. If it's a fighter, draw 2 cards. Otherwise, deal 500 damage to all fighters.\n\nHarken\nBlue Rare\n{R}{B}{B} 800/50\nWhen this card is cast: Draw a card, then obliterate a target allied fighter and put it on top of your deck.\nDuring your end step: Reveal the top card of each deck. If your opponent's card costs more or equal studs to yours, this card gains 880 Power until the next end step.\n\nArtful\nRed Epic\n{G}{G}{B}{B} 700/350\n2G2B 700/350\nWhenever this card attacks: Attach the top card of your opponent's deck to it. Apply an effect based on its colour, then reveal the top card of your opponent's deck -\n{R} - This card gains 200 Power.\n{G} - This card gains 200 Health.\n{B} - Draw a card.\n{Y} - This card generates twice.\n\n\nStalk\nRed Legendary\n{R}{R}{R}{G}{G}{G}{B}{B}{B} Action\nObliterate a target fighter and put a copy of it on top of your opponent's deck.\nSelect one of the 3 top cards of your opponent's deck to stalk, summoning a 1000/1000 Pursuer when it's cast or discarded.\n\nThere's also around 30 new lunas in the shop from the June Commission Sale!\n\nThank you for keeping the lights on in what has been a very turbulent year. We are deeply grateful for your continued support.\n\nPS Void Sap Seer looks different now\n"
